{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, כַּשְׂדָּ֑י","hw":"כַּשְׂדָּ֑י","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">כַּשְׂדָּ֑י</span></big>  <strong>n. pr. gent. Chaldean (</strong>v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, כַּשְׂדִּים\" href=\"/BDB,_כַּשְׂדִּים\", dir=\"rtl\">כַּשְׂדִּים</a><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:10\" href=\"/Daniel.2.10\">Dn 2:10</a>; emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">כשדיא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:30\" href=\"/Daniel.5.30\">Dn 5:30</a> Kt (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּשְׂדָּאָה</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">כסדיא</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:12\" href=\"/Ezra.5.12\">Ezr 5:12</a> Kt (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּסְדָּאָה</span>); pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּשְׂדָּאִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 3:8\" href=\"/Ezra.3.8\">3:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:11\" href=\"/Ezra.5.11\">5:11</a>, emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">כשדיא</span> Kt, <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּשְׂדָּאֵי</span> Qr, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:5\" href=\"/Daniel.2.5\">Dn 2:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:10\" href=\"/Daniel.2.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:4\" href=\"/Daniel.4.4\">4:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:7\" href=\"/Daniel.5.7\">5:7</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>Chaldean</em> by race <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:8\" href=\"/Daniel.3.8\">Dn 3:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:30\" href=\"/Daniel.5.30\">5:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:12\" href=\"/Ezra.5.12\">Ezr 5:12</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  as learned, of the class of Magi (BH <span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳</span> <strong>1 c</strong>), <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:5\" href=\"/Daniel.2.5\">Dn 2:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:10\" href=\"/Daniel.2.10\">10</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:4\" href=\"/Daniel.4.4\">4:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:7\" href=\"/Daniel.5.7\">5:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:11\" href=\"/Daniel.5.11\">11</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, כְּתַב","prev":"BDB Aramaic, כִּכַּר²"}